---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Us & Ours Counselling collects, uses and protects personal information shared through this website.">
<div class="wrap"><section class="legal">
      <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="b-h1 rise" style="--d:.2s">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="draft rise" style="--d:.3s">Draft for Rachel to review before launch.</p>
      <div class="legal-body rise" style="--d:.4s">
        <h2>What this covers</h2><p>This policy explains how Us &amp; Ours Counselling collects and uses personal information through this website. Information shared in counselling sessions is covered separately by the professional and confidentiality standards of the BC Association of Clinical Counsellors.</p>
        <h2>What I collect</h2><p>If you use the question form, I collect your name, email address, topic and message. If you book online, the booking system collects the details it asks for. This site doesn’t use advertising trackers.</p>
        <h2>How I use it</h2><p>Only to reply to you and arrange sessions. I don’t sell or share your information, and I don’t add you to mailing lists.</p>
        <h2>How it’s stored</h2><p>Form messages are delivered by a secure email service and kept in my practice email. Booking details are stored by the booking provider in Canada where available.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2><p>Under BC’s Personal Information Protection Act you can ask to see or correct the personal information I hold about you. Email hello@usandours.com.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2><p>Rachel Glover, RCC · 941 Kings Rd, Victoria, BC · hello@usandours.com</p>
      </div>
    </section></div>
</Base>
